{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Do not</b> — Because Edom was always under the hand of Judah, therefore the joy of Edom over his disaster was hard upon us." "<b>And do not send</b> — An elliptical form. The meaning: your hands; and likewise they shall dig in the valley of his foot."], :book :obadiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {1 "The phrase 'they shall dig in the valley of his foot' is opaque in the Hebrew and rendered hyper-literally; the construction may be textually corrupt or a compressed allusion."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Obadiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=18&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:31.130614015Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}